  "description" : "<notes xmlns=\"http://www.sbml.org/sbml/level2/version4\">      <body xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">        <pre>Its a mechanistic model explaining the impact of p53 om apoptosis decision. This model represents schema 1 of manuscript.</pre>      </body>    </notes>",
